{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/123645-i-wish-that-white-wolf-onyx-path-would-do-x","id":123645,"title":"I wish that White Wolf/ Onyx Path would do X","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-02T00:17:41-07:00","id":123645,"title":"I wish that White Wolf/ Onyx Path would do X","content":"Simple question: What do you wish White Wolf/ Onyx Path would do, if they had the time, resources, and inclination to do so?<br /> <br /> My wish is equally simple: A turn based RPG. Any of their IPs, with characters either moving or standing still (ala' Final Fantasy) in combat. Big focus on delivering a great story with memorable characters, challenges for all three of the holy trinity: Physical, Mental, Social.<br /> <br /> Your turn!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T05:26:39-07:00","id":123731,"title":"","content":"Something along the lines of what Telltale Games did with <i>The Walking Dead</i>. Considering how they've handled their <i>Fables </i>license so far, I'd be excited \u2014 no, downright <i>ecstatic </i>\u2014 if they did something similar with Hunter, Werewolf, Changeling, etc.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T07:24:40-07:00","id":123768,"title":"","content":"If they had the resources? Buy Exalted and the Worlds of Darkness back.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T09:16:04-07:00","id":123810,"title":"","content":"Have a release schedule that is moderately accurate.<br /> <br /> On a side note, OPP doesn't have the rights to any of the WoD or Exalted stuff except specifically table top RPGs, So the video game requests are more &quot;What would you like CCP to do&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T09:16:10-07:00","id":123811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/123645-i-wish-that-white-wolf-onyx-path-would-do-x?p=123768#post123768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If they had the resources? Buy Exalted and the Worlds of Darkness back.</div> </div> </div> </div>This, so much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T12:37:21-07:00","id":123938,"title":"","content":"I'd like it if CCP and Onyx Path collaborated on a wide-open sandbox video game version of either Vampire: The Masquerade or Werewolf: The Apocalypse, complete with a detailed character creator and an open-ended world in the vein of Grand Theft Auto or Saints Row. Just keep it in the metaplot-neutral setting of V20 and W20. And make sure the soundtrack is diverse and not just Goth and Punk music (nothing wrong with either genre, but musical diversity is good!).<br /> <br /> Man, if that was possible, it would be awesome!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1579-camilla","name":"Camilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1579_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T12:47:49-07:00","id":123947,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/123645-i-wish-that-white-wolf-onyx-path-would-do-x?p=123768#post123768\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If they had the resources? Buy Exalted and the Worlds of Darkness back.</div> </div> </div> </div>Scratch my old idea, this. This, so much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">-: <b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations\" target=\"_blank\">First Tongue Translation Requests</a></b> :-</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1874-sikla-alkis","name":"Sikla Alkis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1874_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"833"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T12:48:28-07:00","id":123948,"title":"","content":"<i>Prototype</i> in Crinos? I'd play it. Throw in some destructible environments, have 'em respawn after you leave the area for awhile to save on memory and so that you can come wreck 'em again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T14:42:42-07:00","id":124007,"title":"","content":"Come out with a Ten year anniversary edition of the new world of darkness base book, essentially god machine without the fluff. Take all the material from Blood and Smoke that would be redundant in that book out of blood and smoke and inject all the relevant bits from &quot;Blood Sorcery&quot; to expand Cruac and Theban Sorcery into something approaching the usefulness of the other new expanded disciplines. Oh and add at least five bloodlines (one from each clan) to the book. Also, when they make it a pdf, make it easy to locate what you are looking for via bookmarks.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1720-celebrochan","name":"Celebrochan","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-02T20:04:15-07:00","id":124234,"title":"","content":"Make movies, and TV shows, too, so long as they're cable fare like Game of Thrones, etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T12:48:23-07:00","id":124695,"title":"","content":"Buy it's own nation state and proceed to take over the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T22:54:20-07:00","id":125010,"title":"","content":"Host a gigantic Werewolf Liveaction involving interaction with the Celestine Luna. Hosted on our actual moon.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-05T14:52:10-07:00","id":126157,"title":"","content":"Reprint and support Vampire the Eternal Struggle card game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/405-ragecryx","name":"ragecryx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar405_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"16"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-05T17:27:34-07:00","id":126279,"title":"","content":"I'm pretty sure VtES is another thing that's in CCP's hands, not Onyx Path's hands. Though given the quality of the POD cards we've seen, I think it would be awesome if CCP licensed out the old card games. While there would be a lot of work in digitizing all the cards, but it would keep them in print, effectively, indefinitely.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-06T07:57:25-07:00","id":126703,"title":"","content":"I'd also like that, Onyx Path could buy the WoD properties.<br /> - Free White Wolf -<br /> <br /> Then, they could make a TV series based on Classic World of Darkness,<br /> funded by themselves, because they'd have complete liberty to make justice to the lore<br /> and you wouldn't be watching a mainstream product to please the masses.<br /> <br /> Films? Yeah, they would be great too, although, they'd feel short and compact, you know.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1846-nen","name":"NEN","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-06T09:49:47-07:00","id":126761,"title":"","content":"Yeah, the World of Darkness Anthology series (or something like that) is an idea that's been kicked around for a long time and it's <span style=\"font-size:14px\"><u><i><b>WAY OVER DUE!!</b></i></u></span><br /> <br /> Especially with.....what.....6 different vampire shows on TV right now.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-06T11:04:19-07:00","id":126809,"title":"","content":"It's funny that when it comes to be about vampire products, the negativity appears,<br /> &quot;it's overdue&quot;, &quot;no, no, that's overdone&quot; (something that an EVE player said about the WoD MMO),<br /> but when it's something about sci-fi, outer space,<br /> (i.e. Star Wars, Star Treck, Battlestar Galactica, etc.) then, there isn't<br /> and they're begging for more, more.<br /> <br /> It's a complete different story to make something based on a specific product,<br /> than relate it to things that are part of a genre.<br /> <br /> If somebody made Lord of the Rings, nobody should make Game of Thrones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1846,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1846-nen","user":"NEN","da